          "id": "service-gateway-sync-actions",
          "intent": "Change the two Service Gateway update actions from asynchronous 202/no-content LROs in 2025-05-01 and 2025-07-01 to synchronous 200 status responses in the new 2025-09-01 API version.",
          "transformationChain": [
            "Retain versioned LRO declarations through 2025-07-01 and mark them removed at 2025-09-01.",
            "Add shared-route synchronous replacements at 2025-09-01; existing API-version wire contracts remain unchanged."
